OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's #10m mistake prompts
OL,4,Ainvestigation call
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn opposition councillor has called for
OL,7,Fan investigation after a report claimed
OL,8,Fan error by Bradford Council could cost
OL,9,Ftaxpayers #10m.
OL,11,FA policy introduced by Labour in 2018
OL,12,Fto charge owners of long-term empty
OL,13,Fproperties higher council tax was not
OL,14,Fratified by the full council, meaning
OL,15,Fit was never fully authorised,
OL,16,Faccording to Reform UK, which now leads
OL,17,Fthe authority.
OL,19,FIt was designed to encourage owners to
OL,20,Fbring empty homes back into use.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
