OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's #10m mistake prompts
OL,4,Ainvestigation call
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebecca Poulsen, leader of the
OL,7,FConservatives in Bradford, called the
OL,8,Fnews "absolutely shocking" and called
OL,9,Ffor a full investigation into how
OL,10,Fcouncil bosses were given the wrong
OL,11,Finformation.
